From 58ec8bc5866c3e24c8802912b3745e06a249701c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:49:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test: move the rpc_* tests' extra runs to variants

rpc_bind.py (ipv4, ipv6, nonloopback), rpc_createmultisig.py,
rpc_fundrawtransaction.py, rpc_rawtransaction.py and
rpc_signrawtransaction.py (descriptors) and rpc_deriveaddresses.py (cli)
now declare their extra runs as variants instead of TEST_PARAMS entries
in test_runner.py. Their results and timing.json entries are named
"<file>[<variant>]" instead of "<file> --<flag>". Run one alone with
e.g. rpc_bind.py --variant=ipv4; the old flags still work.

The full functional suite runs the same tests with the same results.
---
 test/functional/rpc_bind.py               |  7 +++++++
 test/functional/rpc_createmultisig.py     |  2 ++
 test/functional/rpc_deriveaddresses.py    |  2 ++
 test/functional/rpc_fundrawtransaction.py |  2 ++
 test/functional/rpc_rawtransaction.py     |  2 ++
 test/functional/rpc_signrawtransaction.py |  2 ++
 test/functional/test_runner.py            |  6 ------
 test/functional/timing.json               | 18 +++++++++---------
 8 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

